@startuml lease-recovery
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #475569
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #64748B
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
skinparam noteBorderColor #D4AF37
skinparam titleFontSize 23
title Lease Recovery Without Stale Publication
autonumber

participant "Scheduler /\nreconciler" as S
database "PostgreSQL\nauthoritative state" as DB
participant "Host A / GPU A\nattempt a1" as A #F3E8FF
collections "Immutable\nobject storage" as O #E0F2FE
participant "Host B / GPU B\nattempt a2" as B #F3E8FF

S -> DB : Short transaction: claim task + GPU A\nPersist token 41, lease expiry and budget reservation
S -> A : Start with token 41 and hard deadline
A -> DB : Renew token 41 lease every 10 s
A -> O : Write checkpoint data, then complete manifest
note over A,DB
Lease duration: 60 s (design default).
Host watchdog stops before its safe lease deadline
if renewal cannot be confirmed.
end note

group Network partition / missed heartbeat
  A -x DB : Renewal cannot be confirmed
  S -> DB : After lease expiry, revoke token 41\nMark attempt lost; QUARANTINE GPU A
  note over S,A
Never treat lease expiry as proof that the GPU is idle.
GPU A stays unavailable until termination and health are confirmed.
  end note
end

S -> DB : If retry count + conservative budget permit:\nclaim healthy GPU B; issue token 42
S -> B : Retry same stage with token 42\nReference latest compatible complete checkpoint
B -> O : Verify manifest / hashes; restore training state
B -> DB : Renew token 42; persist progress

group Old host reconnects
  A -> DB : Late progress / completion with token 41
  DB --> A : Reject stale token; no canonical state change
  S -> A : Confirm process stopped and device healthy
  A --> S : Termination + health acknowledgement
  S -> DB : Release GPU A quarantine only after confirmation
end

B -> O : Write immutable attempt artifacts + complete manifest
B -> DB : Guard token 42 + lease + job state\nComplete task and enqueue next stage atomically
note over S,B
After EVALUATE passes, CPU PUBLISH checks the exact artifact/report.
Model READY + job READY commit together; uniqueness prevents duplicates.
At-least-once execution, fenced and effectively-once publication.
end note
@enduml
